    "detailed_description": "This is a 2D top-down shooter with a flair of parody.<br />\r\nYou need to clutch 16 rounds in a row to win the map.<br />\r\nThere are 10 different maps in the base game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter playing countless hours of Counter-Strike we at Gammis Games decided to make our own game from the most prominent and exiting parts of CS: the clutch. What if you only have clutch situations all the time? What if the terrorists cheat? What if they use robots against you? What if there are aliens on the map? Well, this game is nothing like the clutches in CS. The question is, is it better?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe hope you'll enjoy our little game. Maybe we'll see you on the online leaderboards!?",
